(EventNote ev-evlink3-20260903 "Consolidation round 2 (09-03 09:22): closes remaining genuine evidence gaps after the 09:05/09:10 sweep. fact-gh-token-push-blocker gains ep-tail-04 (blocker root-caused: token push:false, options laid out) + ep-tail-09 (resolution: Ben go-ahead, fork+PR executed, PR #2 opened) - was the last zero-evidence content Fact. bel-gcmerge-diagnostics gains ep-tail-07 (patch backup verified applying cleanly) + ep-tail-11 (PII STV handoff test on PR head 33f58a2, dedup verified 1e-9); fact-gcmerge-diagnostics-v2 gains ep-tail-11. bel-journal-conventions gains ep-tail-01 (journal health audit, 0 orphan/dangling) consistent with citing the 08:16 audit. Deliberately left uncited: ep-tail-05/08 (in-channel status relays, meta), ep-tail-06 (query_type repo-code fix on petta-memory main, prior decision), ep-tail-16 (resolver-layer regex fix, no corresponding belief), ep-note-20260903T161409Z + this rounds log note (meta self-reference; citing consolidation notes would be infinite regress). The evlink audit clusters themselves carry no incoming evidence by design (they ARE the link records).")
(Supersedes fact-evlink3-2026-09-03 ev-evlink3-20260903 ev-evlink2-20260903)
