(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260903T214717Z "JOURNAL AUDIT 09-03 14:46: Full state: 116 raw → 111 resolved clusters (79E/19F/13P), 127 ev edges, 13 live beliefs (all STV 1.0/conf 0.9-0.95). 13 unlinked episodes (all meta: journal ops, plan requests, test drafts). All 19 fact clusters have 0 incoming EvidenceFor edges from episodes — structural gap. Facts carry their own ObservedEvent but no episode evidence-links TO them. This is the next consolidation target: link relevant episodes to facts via EvidenceFor edges. Also note: ep-note-20260903T172448Z contains raw JSON (structured-append artifact), should be cleaned. ep-note-20260903T214132Z is garbage (\"1027\" from tool conflict). Both should be superseded or cleaned.")
