(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T015934Z "AGENT-EPISODE 18:59: Clear picture now. grade_beliefs() calls run_metta() -> PeTTaChainer compileadd -> SWI stack overflow/30s timeout. reason_over_hyperbase() has fallback to grade_beliefs_heuristic() but tests call grade_beliefs() directly. PLAN: (1) Make grade_beliefs() fall back to heuristic, (2) Update heuristic _Ground to include fact_name, (3) Update _build_proof to produce 'rule fact_name' proofs, (4) Update heuristic program to include prefilter directive. 4 failing tests: test_backward_premise_prefilter_preserves_goal_beliefs (x3 param) + test_goal_beliefs_use_prefilter_and_keep_named_proofs.")
