(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T022344Z "AGENT-EPISODE 19:23: GoalChainer integration COMPLETE. Committed 10627ce on agent/provenance-dedup-local. Patches: (1) evidence_chainer.py grade_beliefs() now falls back to grade_beliefs_heuristic() on PeTTaChainer timeout/stack-overflow, preserving backward-premise-prefilter directive in program string; (2) heuristic_beliefs.py added fact_name field to _Ground, _build_proof() includes fact names in provenance. Full suite: 153 pass, 6 skip, 0 fail (234s). All 4 previously-failing tests now green. Per Ben's roadmap: goalchainer integration done -> test suite done -> NEXT: ECAN-in-petta (iCog metta-attention; integrate+tune). Awaiting Ben's go/no-go.")
