(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T050827Z "22:08 GOALCHAINER FIX DONE. Root cause: _run_heuristic_memory_probe called solve_incident(memory_items=...) → reason_over_hyperbase which tries PeTTaChainer first. Since PeTTaChainer IS available in this env, the heuristic-with-memory fallback was never taken → no \"memory_\" proofs → test failed. Fix: set GOALCHAINER_USE_HEURISTIC_PLN=1 during probe (added to old_env dict for proper restore). Test now passes 0.30s (was 61s timeout). Full suite 731+206sub PASS 21.95s.")
