(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T074528Z "09-04 00:44 GOALCHAINER INTEGRATION COMPLETE. 732 tests pass (9 gc smoke + 112 core + 611 rest). HEAD 1d971a6. No uncommitted changes. Precompiled handoff gate live with EC folding + boundary checks. NEXT: ECAN-in-petta integration (iCog metta-attention). Read full metta-attention codebase: attention-bank (setAv/getAv/getSti/getLti/getStv), importance-index (binning), attentional-focus (AF selection by STI threshold + max size), ImportanceDiffusionBase (stochastic diffusion via incident+hebbian probability vectors), AFRentCollectionAgent (time-based STI/LTI rent), HebbianCreationAgent (creates ASYMMETRIC_HEBBIAN_LINK between AF atoms), HebbianUpdatingAgent (targetConjunction + PLN_BOOK_REVISION merge), ForgettingAgent (LTI threshold + TV sort removal). Params: FUNDS_STI/LTI=100k, TARGET=10k, STI_ATOM_WAGE=10, MAX_AF_SIZE=1000, MIN_AF_STI=100k initial, AFRentFrequency=5, FORGET_THRESHOLD=0.05. Roadmap: ECAN BEFORE GOLEM.")
