(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T165554Z "09:55 GOLEM-ITER DESIGN v0.1 written and committed. 11 sections: purpose, architecture, stimulus taxonomy (6 event classes, DMAX=0.30), claim-state ladder (SelfReported->KernelChecked->ExternallyVerified), 2 formal invariants (bounded decrease Lyapunov, no-exclusion at floor), 5-phase implementation plan (G1: stimulus injector, G2: claim-state tagger, G3: context injection transformation, G4: steadfastness gate, G5: floor-tie test suite), 7 non-actions, comparison table with failed Next Move approach, 5 open questions for Ben. Doc at docs/golem-iter-design.md. Committed. Awaiting Ben's review before implementation.")
