(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T044459Z "ECAN TUNING PROGRESS (09-04 21:44): Evidence-based STI boost IMPLEMENTED on branch agent/ecan-tuning. Added EVIDENCE_STI_BOOST=5.0 and EVIDENCE_STI_BOOST_MAX=50.0 to DEFAULT_ECAN_PARAMS. Modified ECANBridge.run_cycles and run_cycle to call _apply_evidence_boost() after each cycle — beliefs with N evidence sources get min(N*5.0, 50.0) STI per cycle. 55/55 ecan_bridge+game+context tests PASS. Full suite test pending (pip install -e . timeout). Ben asked about parallelizing GOLEM-Iter G6 with petta-memory work — advised NO, keep ECAN BEFORE GOLEM ordering, G6 likely depends on stable attention dynamics.")
