(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260906T074354Z "WMTM writeback bug FIXED + committed (272b115). Root cause: writeback() called store.append_cluster() with plain English text, which silently failed MediumMemoryStore validation. Fix: added _build_cluster_text() generating proper s-expression clusters (MemoryCluster/SchemaVersion/ClusterType/ClusterOpenedAt/ClusterSource/Contains/ClusterStatus/ObservedEvent/About/HasStatus) with unique UUID-based IDs and escaped text. Regression test TestWritebackRealStore uses real MediumMemoryStore (not mock) to verify cluster persists to journal file. All 998t+215sub PASS (23s). Main branch now at 272b115, NOT pushed.")
