(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T085336Z "2026-09-08 01:53Z: Goal Relevance Governor Phase 0 — Tasks 1 & 2 COMPLETE.

Task 1: Schema v0.1 (md + JSON Schema) + evaluator with 6 verdict rules.
Task 2: Replay corpus with 5 episodes from real incidents:
  E01: Plain2MeTTa stale codegen worker → STOP_STALE ✓
  E02: petta-chem blocking agent restoration → PAUSE_RECOVERABLY ✓
  E03: Premature hardening of research infra → DEFER ✓
  E04: Over-engineered agent repair path → REPLAN ✓
  E05: Control: justified WMTM benchmark → CONTINUE ✓

Key fix: evaluator now distinguishes direct vs transitive goals (STOP_STALE fires on direct parent being achieved, even if a transitive ancestor is active).

All 5/5 verdicts match expected. Evaluator is 213 lines, pure Python, no external deps.

Now moving to memory consolidation per user instruction.")
