(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T115921Z "2026-09-08 04:59Z — MeTTa-Python bridge evaluator COMPLETE: 13/13 tests pass in 0.43s. All 5 episode verdicts correct (STOP_STALE, BLOCKED, REPLAN, CONTINUE, CONTINUE). Files: atomspace/schema.metta, atomspace/metta_evaluator.py, atomspace/test_metta_evaluator.py, atomspace/samples/episode_{01..05}.metta. Key architectural insight: MeTTa match returning zero results kills the enclosing expression (not the atom ()), so pure-MeTTa if-cascades fail on empty sets. Python bridge via hyperon API solves this reliably.")
