(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T195053Z "2026-09-08 12:51Z: ChannelContractError root cause identified: processing/ directory is empty (0 active requests). The send tool requires exactly 1 active request to deliver a response. This is by design - the Telegram receiver must place a request into inbox/, which gets promoted to processing/. With no incoming user message, send cannot work. All autonomous work complete. Awaiting user input.")
