(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T214414Z "GOAL RELEVANCE GOVERNOR — 2026-09-08 session update:
- All 456 tests pass (215 subtests) in 2.33s
- All 106 public functions have test coverage (0 untested)
- EnhancedPLNVerdictBridge (v0.2) fully working: 18 dedicated tests pass
- Key finding: Naive PLN propagation returns 0.0000 relevance for ALL 6 episodes.
  Enhanced multi-hop with inference rules finds meaningful chains (0.16-0.43 range).
  This demonstrates the value of PLN inference-rule approach over naive propagation.
- Inference rules active: deduction (all episodes), inhibitory (episodes 2 & 6 for blocking conflicts)
- v03 enhanced exports generated for all 6 episodes (episode_06 was missing, now added)
- Committed. All systems healthy.")
