(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260909T173609Z "10:36Z: Deep code review complete. All source files read. Key findings:

1. F05 clock: ALREADY FIXED. decay_sti computes recency=0.9^(age-last_used) before incrementing age. After admit at cycle 100 + 10 ticks: age=10, last_used=0, recency=0.9^10=0.348. Code is correct.

2. F02 dedup: ALREADY FIXED. writeback checks both item.written_back flag AND item.id in self._writeback_receipts. Two items with same text/derived_from get same cluster_id via _stable_derivation_id so store rejects duplicate cluster IDs.

3. F06 stable identity: ALREADY FIXED. derivation_id is content-deterministic SHA256 hash of text+sorted(source_ids). Same conclusion from same sources = same ID.

4. F07 ECAN: ALREADY FIXED. coordinator on_tick() calls ecan.sync_from_store() AND ecan.run_cycle() (lines 88,90). on_turn_end() no longer calls tick() redundantly.

5. F04 provenance: get_provenance handles evicted items with placeholder dict.

CONCLUSION: All Ben's fixes appear to have been applied in commits after d03e3a8. Need to run full test suite to verify.

NEXT: Run tests, check for any failures, fix remaining issues, push to GitHub.")
