(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260909T224035Z "2026-09-09 15:40Z: Identified 5 test files with failures. Analyzing root causes:
1. test_telegram_address_filter: _should_skip_group_response uses message.get('text') but test passes text as msg param, not in message dict. Fix: fallback to msg.
2. test_output_protocol_hardening: balance_parentheses_for_message doesn't parse JSON envelopes or validate (unknown actions, >5 actions, no-reply-during-burst). Need JSON envelope parsing + validation.
3. test_message_envelope: send_message doesn't raise RuntimeError when no active envelope and legacy globals are empty. Fix: raise when env is None and no fallback.
4. test_telegram_send_dedupe: failed sends poison dedupe window. Fix: don't update dedupe key on failure.
5. test_openclaw_prompt_boundary: real HTTP call during repair. Need to check monkeypatch coverage.")
