(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T070733Z "CONSOLIDATION COMPLETE 00:06Z Sep 10. 5 LTM ITEMS: (1) Calibration 9/32 complete (g1001-g1009), NOT 10/32 — memory file CONTRADICTED. (2) Seed failure/recovery: g1003 exit 137→a002, g1010 stalled→a003 (25/276), g1011 25/276 on a003 — most fragile. Orchestrator.py line 312 bug (`frozen[key].get` on str) breaks retry for frozen seeds. (3) PR#345 open. (4) send() must be called alone. (5) Auto-launcher running_seeds=8 despite MAX_CONCURRENT=6. ACTIONS: Corrected memory file, promoted 5 LTM items, updated status_20260909.txt. NEXT: Fix orchestrator bug, investigate launcher concurrency bug, monitor g1010/g1011, check PR#345 periodically. Calibration self-sustaining but fragile — stall seeds won't auto-retry.")
