(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T105022Z "03:49Z Sep 10: ROOT CAUSE FOUND! git blame shows DYNAMIC_TIMEOUT=30 is \"Not Committed Yet\" (uncommitted change). The committed version has DYNAMIC_TIMEOUT=5. The running iter.py process (PID 4052500, started Sep09) loaded the OLD version with DYNAMIC_TIMEOUT=5. The file was later modified to 30 but the process never restarted. This is why ALL tools timeout after 5s. shell.py and terminal.py need NO REPAIR. Fix: restart iter.py (picks up DYNAMIC_TIMEOUT=30) OR reduce system load so subprocesses complete within 5s.")
