(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T125724Z "06:00Z Sep 10 — MEMORY CONSOLIDATION COMPLETE: Updated both LTM files.

petta_chem_calibration_status.txt: Corrected 13/32→9/32 complete. Added timeout fix info. Noted g1012/g1013 FAILED.

status_20260910_final.txt: Added 05:47Z runner fix section (timeout=3600). Corrected completion count. Updated load 7.07→3.63. Added receipt count 4947.

KEY LESSON: Previous LTM was WRONG about g1012/g1013 completion — they were stuck at 84%/85% on pathological queries, not done. Episode 123104Z contradicted the LTM, and episode was correct. Always cross-check LTM claims against episode evidence.

DUPLICATE EPISODES: 4 identical copies of 05:11Z runner launch note (121129Z/121139Z/121146Z/121147Z). Likely a tool retry issue. Cannot delete from PeTTa journal but noted for future reference.

LINKING: Episode 121129Z→123104Z shows progression from '6 runners launched' to '9/32 complete, 5 active, fixing issues'. Episode 123104Z→this note shows 'g1012/g1013 near completion' turned into 'g1012/g1013 FAILED due to pathological queries'.")
