(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T144143Z "07:41Z Sep 10: ROOT CAUSE FOUND:
1) g1001-g1009 COMPLETE (276 receipts each, RUN_MANIFEST.json present). 9/32 genuinely done.
2) g1010-g1023: Each has RUN_MANIFEST.json with 0 receipts, 276 skips - every query failed with 'swipl: not found'. The runner completed but all rows skipped. These are BROKEN, not complete.
3) Root cause: swipl is NOT in PATH for the launcher subprocess. The binary exists at /home/openclaw/research-agent/projects/omegaclaw/local/swipl-9.3.36/bin/swipl and works when PATH is set.
4) Auto-launcher bug: doesn't check for RUN_MANIFEST.json, so it tries to resume 'completed' attempts → runner throws 'completed attempt cannot be resumed' → crash loop.
5) Launcher only covers seeds 1014-1032, missing g1010-g1013.
FIX PLAN: Delete broken 0-receipt attempts, create fixed launcher, restart.")
