- No FAILED.json in any active attempt dir (g1010-g1014) — runners not affected by orchestrator
- Post-calibration pipeline: extract_neutral_calibration_synthetic.py validates all 32 shards (8832 rows), checks identity hashes, schema, receipts. Orchestrator says \"When all 32 complete → halt (BATCH_DONE). No analysis launch.\"
- Stale backup scripts (auto_launch_v3-v7.sh, .bak files) = 64K total, harmless clutter

