2. g1010 advanced to 171/276, g1013 to 173/276 — both just moved to new queries
3. g1015-g1018 have 9 receipts each, g1019-g1022 have 2 receipts each — partial from killed rogue runs
4. g1023-g1032: 0 receipts, fully queued
5. No auto-launcher running. After g1010-g1014 complete, must manually launch g1015+ (or fix launcher)
6. swipl parents are `sh run.sh <query_path>` — one shell per swipl
7. 4416 total receipts across all shards, 9/32 complete, load 7.28, 5 swipl
8. System healthy, all 5 swipl state=R, actively computing")
