(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260911T131625Z "06:15Z Sep 11 — ROOT CAUSE FOUND! Rogue processes caused by systemd user timer: neutral-calibration-orchestrator.timer runs neutral_calibration_orchestrator.py every 2h. Orchestrator launches 4 shards per batch in tmux sessions, but tmux sessions die quickly (shards fail), orchestrator marks as \"interrupted\" and launches next batch on next timer fire. Pattern: g1015-18 (10:17Z) -> g1019-22 (11:04Z) -> g1023-26 (12:21Z) -> g1027-30 (13:03Z). Next batch would be g1031-32. TIMER NOW DISABLED. Tmux sessions killed. Systemd daemon reloaded.")
