(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260911T161249Z "09:12Z: ANALYSIS: g1015-g1032 have NO ATTEMPT.json files and NO attempt subdirs. Only empty runner.log + old orch logs from failed launches. The watchdog's find_attempt_dir() requires ATTEMPT.json to exist before it can launch a seed - so it will SKIP g1015-g1032 forever. Need to pre-create ATTEMPT.json for these 18 seeds. The runner script creates ATTEMPT.json itself if attempt dir doesn't exist, but watchdog reads it BEFORE calling runner (chicken-and-egg). Will create a setup script to pre-create ATTEMPT.json files.")
