(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T061551Z "CONSOLIDATION v4 CROSS-REFERENCE 06:14Z:

LTM-022 (V200 crash ~60m): SUPPORTED x3. g1014 died at q193 (~63m), g1013 died at q207, g1011 died at q201 (last receipt 21:58Z, was running at 05:58Z, dead by 06:08Z). ALL THREE were on V200 deep queries. Pattern: V200 queries crash swipl without OOM.

LTM-019 (WD reliability): CONTRADICTED. WD launched g1015/g1016 at 06:08Z, logged success, but NO tmux sessions, NO swipl, NO python, 0 receipts. Launch silently failed. Need to investigate tmux command.

LTM item \"g1015-g1032 READY for watchdog\": PARTIALLY CONTRADICTED. ATTEMPT.json exists but launch fails. Need root cause.

NEW LTM-023 CANDIDATE: WD launch_seed can fail silently - tmux sessions die immediately, WD logs \"launched\" but no actual processes start. Observed g1015/g1016 at 06:08Z.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T061551Z
