(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T061616Z "06:14Z CRITICAL: WD range is seeds 1015-1032. Seeds g1010-g1014 are OUTSIDE this range and will NEVER be retried by WD. Current dead incomplete shards: g1011(202/276 att-002), g1013(207/276 att-001), g1014(193/276 att-001). None have RUN_MANIFEST.json. These 3 shards need manual relaunch. g1010(200/276) and g1012(202/276) still running. g1015/g1016 launched at 06:08 (0 receipts yet, normal).")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T061616Z
