(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T061636Z "06:15Z CONSOLIDATION v4 ANALYSIS: 

FINDING 1 (LTM-022 STRENGTHENED): g1011 died between 05:58Z-06:08Z. Last receipt q201 at Sep 11 21:58Z — meaning q202 ran ~8 HOURS before crash. This is NOT a 60m crash like g1014. V200 queries can HANG for hours then crash. WD doesn't detect hung swipl (only counts processes). LTM-022 needs amendment: crashes can occur at 60m OR after extremely long hangs (8h+).

FINDING 2 (LTM-023 NEW): WD launch silently fails. tmux new-session creates session, python3 runs but dies immediately. WD logs \"launched\" because tmux returns 0. Root cause likely: v1 shard dir for g1015/g1016 may not exist. Checking.

FINDING 3: WD only counts swipl, doesn't check age or receipt progress. A hung swipl (8h no receipts) is invisible to WD.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T061636Z
