(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260912T200958Z 2026-09-12T20:09:58Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260912T200958Z ev-ep-note-20260912T200958Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260912T200958Z)
(About ep-note-20260912T200958Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T200958Z "LTM-029: g1023 recurrent crashes due to \"unexpected raw file outside next unreceipted row\" - stale raw files from aborted runs confuse the v2 runner. Root cause: when swipl is killed mid-query, partial raw files remain and runner detects them as unexpected. Fix: must clean ALL raw files before relaunch, not just *.stdout/*.stderr.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T200958Z
