(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T201616Z "LTM-030: g1022/g1023 attempt dirs have \"v2 attempt layout is incomplete\" error. Root cause: validate_identity checks ATTEMPT.json matches expected_identity (attempt_id, runtime_identity, source_commit). If attempt_id doesn't match, it may fail. Need to match attempt_id in --attempt-id to what's in ATTEMPT.json. Also g1022 has FileNotFoundError on raw stdout files - previous attempt left partial state.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T201616Z
