(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260912T203634Z "LTM-034: g1017 raw dir can get emptied by previous `rm -f raw/*` clean commands. Must recreate raw/ and receipts/ dirs before relaunching runner. Runner checks for these dirs with is_dir() and raises 'layout is incomplete' if missing.

LTM-035: g1023 DUPLICATE RUNNERS - every `nohup ... &` launch without killing old runners creates a competing process. Must ALWAYS kill all existing runners before launching new one.

LTM-036: g1017 \"unexpected raw file outside next unreceipted row\" - when a runner crashes mid-query, it leaves raw files without receipts. On relaunch, validate_prefix finds these orphan raw files and rejects. FIX: rm raw/* before relaunching.

LTM-037: g1023 att-002 phantom runner appeared from an earlier nohup that I forgot about. Always verify only 1 runner per shard before launching new one.

LTM-038: g1017 python runner keeps crashing immediately after launch. ATTEMPT.json from a previous run has stale `schema` field that doesn't match `identity_for()`. The runner can't validate identity. FIX: delete entire attempt dir and start fresh, losing all receipts.

LTM-039: g1023 python runner crashes after producing 2 receipts. Need to investigate - possibly OOM or file system issue. 2 orphan swipl remain running.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260912T203634Z
