(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051019Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051019Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051019Z "LTM-028: g1014 runner stuck (PID alive, fd deleted, poll_schedule_timeout). Swipl died but parent hung. Fixed by kill+clean orphaned raw+relaunch. Root cause: runner subprocess.communicate() deadlock after swipl crash.
LTM-029: Watchdog runner path fixed: $EXP_ROOT/../omegaclaw resolves to /omegaclaw not /home/openclaw/.../omegaclaw. Hardcoded absolute path in watchdog script.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051019Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051046Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051046Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260913T051046Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260913T051046Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260913T051046Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260913T051046Z 2026-09-13T05:10:46Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260913T051046Z ev-ep-note-20260913T051046Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051046Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051046Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051046Z "LTM-028: Stale runners multiply when relaunching without killing old. Each launch spawns bash+python. Kill old tmux sessions AND processes before relaunch. Also, g1019/g1020/g1022/g1023 crashed because their orphaned raw files were deleted by cleanup script, causing FileNotFoundError in expected_receipt (sha256 of missing stdout). ROOT CAUSE: cleanup deleted orphaned raw files but the runner was already past that index and trying to hash them for receipt. FIX: Only clean orphaned raw files when runner is NOT running.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051046Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051302Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051302Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260913T051302Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260913T051302Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260913T051302Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260913T051302Z 2026-09-13T05:13:02Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260913T051302Z ev-ep-note-20260913T051302Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051302Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051302Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051302Z "LTM-028: Runner v2 uses \"xb\" (exclusive create) for raw files. On resume, completed queries' raw files remain → FileExistsError blocks relaunch. FIX: clean ALL raw files (both completed+orphaned) before relaunch. Applied 22:12Z.
LTM-029: g1014 runner path resolved to /omegaclaw/... (broken symlink) instead of /home/openclaw/.../omegaclaw/. Watchdog RUNNER fixed to absolute path.
Status 22:12Z: g1010-g1013 DONE. Relaunching g1014-g1023 after full raw cleanup. Watchdog restarted.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051302Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051304Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051304Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260913T051304Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260913T051304Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260913T051304Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260913T051304Z 2026-09-13T05:13:04Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260913T051304Z ev-ep-note-20260913T051304Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051304Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051304Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051304Z "LTM-028 RESOLVED: Root cause of mass stalls: (a) runner path resolved to /omegaclaw/repos/PeTTa/run.sh (wrong, should be /home/openclaw/.../omegaclaw/repos/PeTTa/run.sh), (b) raw files for completed queries blocked relaunch with FileExistsError (open mode \"xb\"), (c) orphaned raw files (no receipt) caused FileNotFoundError in receipt generation. FIX: Clean ALL raw files (completed+orphaned) before relaunch. Use absolute runner path. Fix watchdog script runner path.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051304Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051352Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051352Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260913T051352Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260913T051352Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260913T051352Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260913T051352Z 2026-09-13T05:13:52Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260913T051352Z ev-ep-note-20260913T051352Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051352Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051352Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051352Z "LTM-030: validate_prefix() calls expected_receipt() which sha256s raw stdout/stderr. If raw files were deleted, runner crashes on resume. FIX: delete orphaned raw files ONLY when runner is NOT running. Runner uses output.open(\"xb\") which fails with FileExistsError if raw file already exists (even without receipt). Must delete orphaned raw before relaunch.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051352Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051748Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051748Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260913T051748Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260913T051748Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260913T051748Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260913T051748Z 2026-09-13T05:17:48Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260913T051748Z ev-ep-note-20260913T051748Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260913T051748Z)
(About ep-note-20260913T051748Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T051748Z "LTM-030 CRITICAL: validate_prefix has FileNotFoundError handler that trusts receipt sha256 when raw files are missing. BUT creating EMPTY placeholder raw files breaks this - empty file exists but sha256 != receipt sha256. FIX: When raw files are missing, leave them MISSING. The code handles it. Never create placeholder raw files.
LTM-031 CRITICAL: Watchdog RUNNER path was double-nested: /home/openclaw/research-agent/projects/home/openclaw/research-agent/projects/omegaclaw/... Fixed to correct absolute path.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T051748Z
