(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260913T084926Z "01:48Z MEMORY CONSOLIDATION v7: Analysis of 5 recent episodes vs LTM items.

CORRECTIONS TO EXISTING LTM:
1. LTM-022 REVISION: \"V200 crash at ~60min\" is QUERY-SPECIFIC, not time-based. g1014 q196 (V50) completed at 66min without crash. g1015 has NO V200 receipts (all V100). Crash observed only on q193.
2. LTM-024 REVISION: Failure mode (a) \"crash ~60m\" is not a hard time limit. Some queries complete at 66min. Crash is content/query-dependent.
3. LTM-045 CORRECTION: g1014 q196 was V50 (not V200). Receipt: 196-population-scaling-control-L5-f2-7-V50-g1014. g1015 \"V200 deep query\" was actually V100 (all 139 receipts are V100). Only g1014 and g1016 have V200 receipts.

NEW FINDINGS:
- g1015 has ZERO V200 receipts (all 139 are V100). The \"~62m deep query\" was V100.
- g1014 q196 at 66min was V50, not V200. V50 can take 60+ min.
- g1016 V200 queries take ~35min each (152→153: 35m, 153→154: 36m). Normal V200.
- g1014 V200 timing: q194→q195 = 3.75h (includes multiple V200 sub-queries d2001-d2004).

NEW LTM ITEMS:
LTM-046: Multiple simultaneous deep queries cause temporary receipt stalls (~5min, 0 new receipts). Resolves when queries complete. Links: ep-01:40Z.
LTM-047: V50 queries can take 60+ min (g1014 q196 V50 at 66min). Not just V200. Links: ep-01:33Z.
LTM-048: g1015 runs ONLY V100 queries (139/139 V100, 0 V200). Query type distribution is seed-dependent. Links: ep-01:39Z.
LTM-049: g1016 V200 queries take ~35min each (normal). g1014 V200 can take 3-4h for a full d2001-d2004 batch. Links: g1016 receipts 152-154.
LTM-050: Load with 11 swipl reaches 14-18 (supersedes LTM-002/027 which recorded 10.28 with 5 swipl).

EPISODE LINKS:
- ep-01:33Z → SUPPORTS LTM-045 (corrected: V50), CONTRADICTS LTM-022 (query-specific)
- ep-01:39Z → SUPPORTS LTM-048 (g1015 V100 only), CONTRADICTS LTM-022
- ep-01:40Z → SUPPORTS LTM-046 (stall), SUPPORTS LTM-050 (load 16.2)
- ep-01:45Z → SUPPORTS LTM-050 (load ~16), SUPPORTS LTM-046 resolution
- ep-01:50Z → SUPPORTS system stability, 3hr autonomous confirmed

CONSOLIDATION v7: 35 LTM items (30 original + 5 new), link rate ~98%.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260913T084926Z
