(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260914T063135Z "CONSOLIDATION — LTM-007 V200 MARATHON RECORDS: Journal episodes show conflicting g1015 marathon durations (109, 111, 113, 115min reported at different timestamps). RESOLVED: g1015 crashed at ~111min (PID 3293866→3483769). The 109/113/115min reports were from successive checks as g1014 approached, not g1015. g1014 STILL RUNNING @110.7min on original PID 3335408. Current verified ranking: g1014@115min(record, earlier session) > g1015@111min(2nd) > g1010@88min. If g1014 passes 115min in THIS run, new all-time record.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063135Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063145Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063145Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260914T063145Z medium-memory-v1)
