(About ep-note-20260914T063145Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260914T063145Z "CONSOLIDATION — LTM-008 CRASH RECEIPT PATTERN: Episodes confirm: g1015 crashed WITH +1 (186), g1024 crashed WITH +1 (135), g1017 crashed WITH +1 (147), g1019 crashed WITH +1 (150). ALL 4 recent crashes produced receipts! This contradicts the \"crash w/o receipt\" pattern for g1014 and g1016 (which lost receipts). HYPOTHESIS: Seeds that crash at moderate load (~23-25) tend to produce receipts (query completes before crash). Seeds that crash under high load (35+) lose receipts (OOM kills mid-query). LTM-003 receipt data loss at high load confirmed.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063145Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063155Z
