(About ep-note-20260914T063155Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260914T063155Z "CONSOLIDATION — LTM-002 V200 TOLERANCE: Current data strongly supports load-dependent survival formula. At load 23-25: g1015 survived 111min, g1014 surviving 110+min. At load 35: g1020 crashed at 72min. Formula: crash_min ≈ 72 + (35-load)*3.3. At load 24: predicted ~108min. g1014@110.7min has EXCEEDED the formula prediction by 2.7min — suggesting the 115min upper bound is a soft limit, not hard. If g1014 survives past 115min, LTM-002 upper bound needs revision to 120min+.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063155Z
