(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260914T063203Z "CONSOLIDATION — LTM-016 TMUX AGGRESSION: Episodes confirm tmux auto-restarts crashed seeds in <1min (g1017@13s, g1019@2s). This keeps swipl count at 11, blocking WD. HOWEVER: if 3 seeds crash simultaneously (g1014, g1016, g1022 all in crash zone), tmux may not restart all instantly → brief window with <11 swipl → WD launches g1025! The aggressive restart helps recover receipts but prevents queue drainage.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260914T063203Z
