(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T020331Z "19:03Z: Answered Ben on GoalChainer-WMTM-Iter interop. Key points: (1) Evidence handoff already implemented via goalchainer_smoke.py, (2) Shared PLN layer - WMTM atomspace as PeTTaChainer query target, (3) Goal memory in WMTM not yet built. Iter runtime goal system is minimal (text prompt at line 866). Proposed 3 integration levels: L1 goal representation in WMTM (no iter changes), L2 goal-oriented task selection (needs iter hook), L3 full goal lifecycle. Waiting for Ben's feedback on approach. PeTTa V2: 5949/8832 (67%), 10 swipl, load ~14, no crashes.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260917T020331Z
