(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T020937Z "19:12Z: PeTTa V2: 5950/8832 (67%), 10 swipl alive (confirmed via ps), load 13.23. Stable, no crashes. Sent Ben two responses: (1) WMTM has no hard atom count limits - capacity is a constructor parameter, tested at 500/2000/5000 items fine. (2) GoalChainer-WMTM-Iter interop: 3 integration levels proposed. Analyzed GoalChainer's 7-layer pipeline (Perception→Norms→Belief→Reasoning→Motivation→Coordination→Decision). Key insight: PeTTaChainer and WMTM share PLN truth-value semantics, so unifying them means WMTM atomspace IS the PeTTaChainer query target.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260917T020937Z
