(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T082609Z "PLN->Orchestrator integration COMPLETE 2026-09-17. All 320 tests pass. Changes: (1) orchestrator.py refactored - PLN inference runs as step 2b via pln_bridge.run_pln_inference_over_wmtm(), use_pln=True default, CycleResult gains pln_admitted field. (2) inference.py fixed - evidence_aggregation and induction content strings no longer include variable source counts, preventing infinite re-derivation. (3) test_pln_orchestrator.py: 8 new tests for PLN-orchestrator integration. (4) test_wmtm_inference.py updated for new aggregation content format. Next: GoalChainer->orchestrator feedback loop, end-to-end pipeline test.")
