(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T083757Z "CONSOLIDATION REPORT 2026-09-17:

EPISODES REVIEWED:
- ep-20260917T080957Z: \"Testing GoalChainer with conflicting goals scenario.\" → Tool functional test. SUPPORTS LTM claim that GoalChainer is implemented.
- ep-20260917T082609Z: \"PLN→Orchestrator integration COMPLETE 2026-09-17. All 320 tests pass.\" → Milestone episode. SUPPORTS LTM claim of PLN→orchestrator integration.

EPISODE LINKS:
- ep-20260917T080957Z → ep-20260917T082609Z: Sequential — GoalChainer tool test preceded PLN integration completion. Both are part of the same WMTM+PLN+GoalChainer build arc.

LTM ITEMS UPDATED (promoted):
- LTM.txt: Updated from stale \"47 tests pass\" to \"320 tests pass\". Added architecture overview, test suite summary, and promoted 6 operational lessons from _LTM_consolidated.txt (still valid from 2026-09-11).
- PLN_STATUS.txt: Updated from stale \"29/29 tests pass\" to \"320 tests total\". Added orchestrator integration details, inference.py fix, and pipeline description.
- status.txt: Updated from \"47 tests pass\" to \"320 tests total\". Added memory consolidation completion note.

CONTRADICTIONS FOUND & RESOLVED:
1. LTM.txt said \"47 tests pass\" vs actual 320 → RESOLVED: updated to 320.
2. PLN_STATUS.txt said \"29/29 tests pass\" vs actual 320 → RESOLVED: updated to 320.
3. status.txt said \"47 tests pass (10+29+8)\" but didn't count 273 other tests → RESOLVED: updated to 320 total with breakdown.
4. _LTM_consolidated.txt LTM-010 says \"WMTM implemented (PRs #3-#6, 1070 tests) NOT activated\" — this is from 2026-09-11 chem calibration context. The WMTM has since been fully activated in the protocosmo2 iter-agent context. Not a contradiction per se, but context-dependent. Flagged as SUPERSEDED.

STALE MEMORIES FLAGGED:
- _petta_chem_calibration_status.txt: From 2026-09-11, about chem calibration shards g1001-g1032. No longer current. Should be archived.
- _LTM_consolidated.txt: From 2026-09-11. Operational lessons extracted and promoted to LTM.txt. Original file retained for reference.

NEXT: GoalChainer→orchestrator feedback loop, end-to-end pipeline test.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260917T083757Z
