(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T094706Z "GoalChainer→orchestrator feedback loop COMPLETE 2026-09-17.

New files:
- wmtm/goalchainer_bridge.py: Bridge module. wmtm_to_goalchainer_evidence (extracts WMTM active set → GoalChainer memory_items format), run_goalchainer (calls GoalChainer pipeline), goalchainer_result_to_candidates (converts decisions → InferenceCandidates with deontic status, STI boost for recommended/obligated, confidence clamping), run_goalchainer_over_wmtm (full feedback loop).
- test_goalchainer_orchestrator.py: 19 tests (5 conversion, 3 evidence extraction, 2 bridge function, 9 orchestrator integration including mocked candidate admission).

Modified:
- orchestrator.py: Added use_goalchainer + goalchainer_request params, _run_goalchainer_phase method (step 2c in cycle), gc_admitted field in CycleResult. Cycle order: recall→attention→inference→PLN(2b)→GoalChainer(2c)→admit→contradictions→forget→writeback.

Test results: 329 passed (19 new + 310 existing), 3 pre-existing timeouts unchanged. No regressions.

Architecture now: WMTM active set → PLN inference (step 2b) → GoalChainer decisions (step 2c) → both admitted back into WMTM. Full cognitive cycle closes the loop: perception→reasoning→decision→memory update.

Next: end-to-end pipeline test (simulated scenario exercising all components together).")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260917T094706Z
