(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260917T095501Z "End-to-end pipeline test COMPLETE 2026-09-17.

New file: test_e2e_pipeline.py — 10 tests covering:
1. Full cycle with PLN + GoalChainer (mocked) — verifies decision admitted to WMTM
2. Multi-cycle knowledge accumulation — 3 cycles, knowledge grows
3. GoalChainer decision provenance — source IDs carried through
4. PLN derives knowledge from structured facts
5. Graceful degradation without GoalChainer (PLN only)
6. Graceful degradation without PLN (GoalChainer only)
7. Full cycle with writeback callback
8. Forgetting works in full cycle (capacity eviction)
9. Contradiction detection in cycle
10. Attention decay across cycles

Also fixed 2 tests in test_goalchainer_orchestrator.py that were calling real GoalChainer (slow): test_enabled_goalchainer_nonempty_store_no_crash and test_non_empty_store_no_crash now mock the slow internals.

Final count: 334 passed (10 E2E + 19 goalchainer + 305 existing), 3 pre-existing timeouts (test_wmtm_recall, test_invoke_dynamic_path_collision x2). Zero regressions.")
